{
  "description": "PinyinPal page inventory — the machine-readable page contract and divergence snapshot. One entry per page container under apps/frontend/src/pages/** plus the Learn home ('/learn'). An entry is 'conforms' when it declares an archetype, a component, mode/chrome derived from that archetype, and anatomy matching it; 'diverges' surfaces the gap (redirect by design, unassigned archetype, or anatomy not yet audited). Enforced by scripts/check-page-inventory.mjs.",
